== J16 (D5): customer JOIN cte cust JOIN real nation, GROUP BY n_regionkey — fan-out agg across non-ancestor sibling, permanent rejection ==
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Aggregation references a column from a join branch that is not an ancestor of the aggregation leaf. Fan-out aggregation across a non-ancestor sibling (e.g. a real-table child alongside a CTE lookup under the same parent) is not yet supported.

== J17 (D5): same 3-table chain, GROUP BY n_name, two SUMs — permanent rejection ==
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Aggregation references a column from a join branch that is not an ancestor of the aggregation leaf. Fan-out aggregation across a non-ancestor sibling (e.g. a real-table child alongside a CTE lookup under the same parent) is not yet supported.

== J20 (D21): WRONG-column multi-key lookup — binds aggregate output x.n, not PK col k2 — permanent rejection ==
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE lookup key references a CTE output column that is not part of the virtual primary key.  The virtual CTE primary key matches the CTE body's GROUP BY column list.
